Package: mouseExperimentDashboard
Title: Interactive Dashboard for mouseExperiment Analysis
Version: 26.06.004
Date: 2026-06-02
Authors@R: 
    person("David", "Woods", , "david@sciomics.bio", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: David Woods [aut, cre]
Maintainer: David Woods <david@sciomics.bio>
Description: Provides an interactive web-based dashboard interface for the mouseExperiment
    package. Users can upload tumor growth data, configure analysis parameters through
    a point-and-click interface, and interactively explore statistical results and
    visualizations without requiring R programming knowledge.
License: Proprietary + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports:
    shiny (>= 1.7.0),
    shinycssloaders (>= 1.0.0),
    shinyFeedback (>= 0.4.0),
    shinyjs (>= 2.1.0),
    DT (>= 0.28),
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    tidyr (>= 1.3.0),
    scales (>= 1.2.0),
    emmeans (>= 1.8.0),
    survminer (>= 0.4.9),
    colourpicker (>= 1.1.1),
    sortable (>= 0.4.4),
    htmlwidgets (>= 1.6.0),
    logger (>= 0.3.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0),
    wesanderson (>= 0.3.7),
    mouseExperiment (>= 0.4.6)
Suggests:
    future (>= 1.33.0),
    promises (>= 1.2.0),
    brms (>= 2.19),
    bayesplot (>= 1.10),
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    shinytest2 (>= 0.2.0),
    chromote,
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
